      <p class="lead">Hi, I'm {{ site.name }}, a photographer based in Auburn, Maine.</p>
      <p>Photography is my hobby and my passion, and what I love most is capturing moments. A single picture can hold so much emotion when it's taken at just the right time: a laugh, a quiet glance, a dog mid-grin, the sky going dark at totality. I photograph animals, the people I love, and the moments in between, always waiting for that instant when a feeling shows itself.</p>
      <p>I graduated from the University of Maine in Orono in 2018 with majors in studio art and art education, plus minors in graphic design and art history. While I was there, my photograph <a href="/photography/light-columns/">Light columns</a> received an award at the 2017 Juried Student Art Exhibition.</p>
      <p>Design is part of my work too: I created the <a href="/projects/">logo for Windham Parks &amp; Recreation</a>, which the department used on its website from 2016 until 2025.</p>
      <p>I hope a few of these photos make you smile.</p>

